{
  "glassbox": 1,
  "id": "washing-machine",
  "title": "Washing machine",

  "notes": [
    "Chosen because its natural authoring is a SEQUENCE — fill, then wash, then",
    "drain, then rinse, then spin — and the format has no word for 'and then'.",
    "Every step of the chain is hand-wired here: each state names its successor",
    "on `step-done`. Reordering the programme means editing every rule in the",
    "chain, which is exactly the kind of restructuring the graphical editor is",
    "supposed to make free.",
    "",
    "The sharper problem is RINSE COUNT. A machine that rinses three times has",
    "no more modes than one that rinses twice — rinsing is rinsing — so the",
    "count cannot be states without duplicating the cycle. And it cannot be",
    "config either, because config is read, never counted down: this format",
    "gives a machine no memory beyond the state it is in.",
    "",
    "The resolution is the same one the elevator forced: the host keeps the",
    "number and reports a fact. `more-rinses` is the drum controller counting,",
    "not the machine.",
    "",
    "Pause makes it three. Resuming must return to whatever step was",
    "interrupted — a Harel history state — and this format has no history, so",
    "`paused-in-*` facts carry it and the host remembers. Three instances of one",
    "rule: COUNTS, INDICES, POSITIONS AND HISTORY LIVE IN THE HOST, because a",
    "machine here has no memory beyond the state it is in. Nothing in the format",
    "says so, and a designer who does not know it will build a state per rinse",
    "and a paused-state per step."
  ],

  "initial": "idle",

  "states": [
    { "id": "idle",         "label": "Idle" },
    { "id": "locking",      "label": "Locking" },
    { "id": "prewashing",   "label": "Prewash" },
    { "id": "filling",      "label": "Filling" },
    { "id": "washing",      "label": "Washing" },
    { "id": "draining",     "label": "Draining" },
    { "id": "rinse-filling","label": "Rinse fill" },
    { "id": "rinsing",      "label": "Rinsing" },
    { "id": "spinning",     "label": "Spinning" },
    { "id": "unlocking",    "label": "Unlocking" },
    { "id": "done",         "label": "Done", "final": true },
    { "id": "paused",       "label": "Paused" }
  ],

  "events": [
    { "id": "start",     "label": "start",        "source": "user" },
    { "id": "pause",     "label": "pause",        "source": "user" },
    { "id": "resume",    "label": "resume",       "source": "user" },
    { "id": "cancel",    "label": "cancel",       "source": "user" },
    { "id": "open",      "label": "open door",    "source": "user" },
    { "id": "step-done", "label": "step complete", "source": "runtime" }
  ],

  "config": [
    { "id": "has-prewash", "label": "Prewash in this programme", "default": false }
  ],

  "facts": [
    { "id": "door-shut",   "label": "The door is shut" },
    { "id": "more-rinses",     "label": "The controller wants another rinse" },
    { "id": "drum-wet",        "label": "There is water in the drum" },
    { "id": "paused-in-fill",  "label": "Paused while filling" },
    { "id": "paused-in-rinse", "label": "Paused while rinsing" }
  ],

  "refusals": [
    { "id": "door-ajar",    "text": "the door is not shut" },
    { "id": "door-locked",  "text": "the door is locked while the drum is running" },
    { "id": "still-wet",    "text": "the drum must drain before the door opens" },
    { "id": "not-running",  "text": "nothing is running" }
  ],

  "rules": [
    { "from": "idle", "on": "start", "cases": [
      { "when": { "not": { "fact": "door-shut" } }, "refuse": "door-ajar" },
      { "to": "locking" }
    ]},
    { "from": "idle", "on": "open",      "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "idle", "on": "pause",     "cases": [ { "refuse": "not-running" } ] },
    { "from": "idle", "on": "resume",    "cases": [ { "refuse": "not-running" } ] },
    { "from": "idle", "on": "cancel",    "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "idle", "on": "step-done", "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },

    { "from": "locking", "on": "step-done", "cases": [
      { "when": { "config": "has-prewash" }, "to": "prewashing" },
      { "to": "filling" }
    ]},
    { "from": "locking", "on": "cancel", "cases": [ { "to": "unlocking" } ] },
    { "from": "locking", "on": "open",   "cases": [ { "refuse": "door-locked" } ] },
    { "from": "locking", "on": "pause",  "cases": [ { "to": "paused" } ] },
    { "from": "locking", "on": "resume", "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "locking", "on": "start",  "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },

    { "from": "prewashing", "on": "step-done", "cases": [ { "to": "draining" } ] },
    { "from": "prewashing", "on": "pause",     "cases": [ { "to": "paused" } ] },
    { "from": "prewashing", "on": "cancel",    "cases": [ { "to": "draining" } ] },
    { "from": "prewashing", "on": "open",      "cases": [ { "refuse": "door-locked" } ] },
    { "from": "prewashing", "on": "resume",    "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "prewashing", "on": "start",     "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },

    { "from": "filling", "on": "step-done", "cases": [ { "to": "washing" } ] },
    { "from": "filling", "on": "pause",     "cases": [ { "to": "paused" } ] },
    { "from": "filling", "on": "cancel",    "cases": [ { "to": "draining" } ] },
    { "from": "filling", "on": "open",      "cases": [ { "refuse": "door-locked" } ] },
    { "from": "filling", "on": "resume",    "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "filling", "on": "start",     "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },

    { "from": "washing", "on": "step-done", "cases": [ { "to": "draining" } ] },
    { "from": "washing", "on": "pause",     "cases": [ { "to": "paused" } ] },
    { "from": "washing", "on": "cancel",    "cases": [ { "to": "draining" } ] },
    { "from": "washing", "on": "open",      "cases": [ { "refuse": "door-locked" } ] },
    { "from": "washing", "on": "resume",    "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "washing", "on": "start",     "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },

    { "from": "draining", "on": "step-done", "cases": [
      { "when": { "fact": "more-rinses" }, "to": "rinse-filling" },
      { "to": "spinning" }
    ]},
    { "from": "draining", "on": "pause",  "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "draining", "on": "cancel", "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "draining", "on": "open",   "cases": [ { "refuse": "door-locked" } ] },
    { "from": "draining", "on": "resume", "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "draining", "on": "start",  "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },

    { "from": "rinse-filling", "on": "step-done", "cases": [ { "to": "rinsing" } ] },
    { "from": "rinse-filling", "on": "pause",     "cases": [ { "to": "paused" } ] },
    { "from": "rinse-filling", "on": "cancel",    "cases": [ { "to": "draining" } ] },
    { "from": "rinse-filling", "on": "open",      "cases": [ { "refuse": "door-locked" } ] },
    { "from": "rinse-filling", "on": "resume",    "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "rinse-filling", "on": "start",     "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },

    { "from": "rinsing", "on": "step-done", "cases": [ { "to": "draining" } ] },
    { "from": "rinsing", "on": "pause",     "cases": [ { "to": "paused" } ] },
    { "from": "rinsing", "on": "cancel",    "cases": [ { "to": "draining" } ] },
    { "from": "rinsing", "on": "open",      "cases": [ { "refuse": "door-locked" } ] },
    { "from": "rinsing", "on": "resume",    "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "rinsing", "on": "start",     "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },

    { "from": "spinning", "on": "step-done", "cases": [ { "to": "unlocking" } ] },
    { "from": "spinning", "on": "pause",     "cases": [ { "to": "paused" } ] },
    { "from": "spinning", "on": "cancel",    "cases": [ { "to": "unlocking" } ] },
    { "from": "spinning", "on": "open",      "cases": [ { "refuse": "door-locked" } ] },
    { "from": "spinning", "on": "resume",    "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "spinning", "on": "start",     "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },

    { "from": "unlocking", "on": "step-done", "cases": [
      { "when": { "fact": "drum-wet" }, "refuse": "still-wet" },
      { "to": "done" }
    ]},
    { "from": "unlocking", "on": "open",   "cases": [ { "refuse": "door-locked" } ] },
    { "from": "unlocking", "on": "pause",  "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "unlocking", "on": "resume", "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "unlocking", "on": "cancel", "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "unlocking", "on": "start",  "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },

    { "from": "done", "on": "open",      "cases": [ { "to": "idle" } ] },
    { "from": "done", "on": "start",     "cases": [ { "to": "locking" } ] },
    { "from": "done", "on": "pause",     "cases": [ { "refuse": "not-running" } ] },
    { "from": "done", "on": "resume",    "cases": [ { "refuse": "not-running" } ] },
    { "from": "done", "on": "cancel",    "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "done", "on": "step-done", "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },

    { "from": "paused", "on": "resume", "cases": [
      { "when": { "fact": "paused-in-rinse" }, "to": "rinsing" },
      { "when": { "fact": "paused-in-fill" }, "to": "filling" },
      { "to": "washing" }
    ]},
    { "from": "paused", "on": "cancel",    "cases": [ { "to": "draining" } ] },
    { "from": "paused", "on": "open",      "cases": [ { "refuse": "door-locked" } ] },
    { "from": "paused", "on": "pause",     "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "paused", "on": "start",     "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] },
    { "from": "paused", "on": "step-done", "cases": [ { "stay": true } ] }
  ],

  "deadlines": []
}
